{"page":292,"verses":[{"verse_key":"17:97","surah":17,"ayah":97,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَن يَهْدِ ٱللَّهُ فَهُوَ ٱلْمُهْتَدِ ۖ وَمَن يُضْلِلْ فَلَن تَجِدَ لَهُمْ أَوْلِيَآءَ مِن دُونِهِۦ ۖ وَنَحْشُرُهُمْ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ عَلَىٰ وُجُوهِهِمْ عُمْيًا وَبُكْمًا وَصُمًّا ۖ مَّأْوَىٰهُمْ جَهَنَّمُ ۖ كُلَّمَا خَبَتْ زِدْنَـٰهُمْ سَعِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], anyone God guides is truly guided, and you will find no protector other than Him for anyone He leaves astray. On the Day of Resurrection We shall gather them, lying on their faces, blind, dumb, and deaf. Hell will be their Home. Whenever the Fire goes down, We shall make it blaze more fiercely for them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"17:97"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَهْدِ","en_gloss":"Allah guides","transliteration":"yahdi","verse_key":"17:97"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah guides","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"17:97"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَهُوَ","en_gloss":"then he (is)","transliteration":"fahuwa","verse_key":"17:97"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْمُهْتَدِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the guided one","transliteration":"l-muh'tadi","verse_key":"17:97"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"17:97"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُضْلِلْ","en_gloss":"He lets go astray ","transliteration":"yuḍ'lil","verse_key":"17:97"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَلَن","en_gloss":"then never","transliteration":"falan","verse_key":"17:97"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَجِدَ","en_gloss":"you will find","transliteration":"tajida","verse_key":"17:97"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"17:97"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءَ","en_gloss":"protectors","transliteration":"awliyāa","verse_key":"17:97"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"17:97"},{"pos":13,"ar":"دُونِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"dūnihi","verse_key":"17:97"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَنَحْشُرُهُمْ","en_glo