rse_key":"17:100"}]},{"verse_key":"17:101","surah":17,"ayah":101,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ ءَاتَيْنَا مُوسَىٰ تِسْعَ ءَايَـٰتٍۭ بَيِّنَـٰتٍ ۖ فَسْـَٔلْ بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ إِذْ جَآءَهُمْ فَقَالَ لَهُۥ فِرْعَوْنُ إِنِّى لَأَظُنُّكَ يَـٰمُوسَىٰ مَسْحُورًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In the past, We gave Moses nine clear signs- ask the Children of Israel. When Moses came to [the Egyptians], Pharaoh said to him, ‘Moses, I think you are bewitched.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَا","en_gloss":"We had given","transliteration":"ātaynā","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مُوسَىٰ","en_gloss":"Musa","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تِسْعَ","en_gloss":"nine","transliteration":"tis'ʿa","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتٍۭ","en_gloss":"Signs","transliteration":"āyātin","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"bayyinātin","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَسْـَٔلْ","en_gloss":"so ask","transliteration":"fasal","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"(the) Children of Israel","transliteration":"banī","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","en_gloss":"(the) Children of Israel","transliteration":"is'rāīla","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":11,"ar":"جَآءَهُمْ","en_gloss":"he came to them","transliteration":"jāahum","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَقَالَ","en_gloss":"then said","transliteration":"faqāla","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"to him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِرْعَوْنُ","en_gloss":"Firaun","transliteration":"fir'ʿawnu","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِنِّى","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"17:101"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَأَظُنُّكَ","en_gloss":"[I] think you ","translit